// CarrierEvent. This counter can roll over very quickly. A management
// station is advised to poll the ifMauHCFalseCarriers instead of this
// counter in order to avoid loss of information. Discontinuities in the
// value of this counter can occur at re-initialization of the management
// system and at other times, as indicated by the value of
// ifCounterDiscontinuityTime.
